            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>WakeBee 0.15.2</title><h1>WakeBee 0.15.2</h1><p>Updated app and installer artwork with the latest bee logo. Session controls, licensing, and closed-lid behavior are unchanged.</p><p>End your session and keep the lid open during installation. Versions 0.14 and earlier require a one-time manual migration.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/jswladitya/WakeBee-Releases/releases/tag/v0.15.2">Installation and migration instructions</a></p></html>
]]></description>
