            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>WakeBee 0.15.1</title><h1>WakeBee 0.15.1</h1><ul><li>New bee icon for the app and installer.</li><li>Fixed closed-lid setup trying to unregister a missing helper.</li><li>License errors now show the failed Keychain operation and macOS error code.</li></ul><p>End your session and keep the lid open during installation. Versions 0.14 and earlier require a one-time manual migration.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/jswladitya/WakeBee-Releases/releases/tag/v0.15.1">Installation and migration instructions</a></p></html>
]]></description>
