        <item>
            <title>0.15.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 09:13:49 +0530</pubDate>
            <link>https://www.wakebee.app</link>
            <sparkle:version>27</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>WakeBee 0.15.0</title><h1>WakeBee 0.15.0</h1><p>WakeBee now uses its own Apple app and helper identifiers. Saved preferences and Polar activations migrate on first launch.</p><p><strong>Upgrading from 0.14 or earlier requires a one-time manual install.</strong> Keep the lid open, end your session, remove closed-lid setup in the old app’s Settings, disable its Launch at login, and quit it before installing.</p><p>After installing, allow Keychain access if prompted, verify your license online, and set up closed-lid mode and Launch at login again if desired.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/jswladitya/WakeBee-Releases/releases/tag/v0.15.0">Full installation and migration instructions</a></p></html>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/jswladitya/WakeBee-Releases/releases/download/v0.15.0/WakeBee-0.15.0.zip" length="4570498" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="HZ9ObKLRJGrANDW8ODHFdUdLVfdRTVzIZ1CMmqIu3bcqdNCM08/jmux+tueVdp75Yr1crHP38dUQ5IDluxPlAA=="/>
